# Speech to text for earnings-call recordings (transcripts/speech.py). Only the
# call-recordings workflow installs this: its plan job on top of the core lock
# and its piece jobs on its own, which is why the packages they share are
# constrained to the core lock's versions. Deliberately outside requirements.in
# -- nothing in the scoring path imports it, and it must not reach the run
# manifest. Edit this file, then regenerate the lock (see its header).
-c requirements-ci.txt

